menu "Vektora OLED CPU test"

    config OLED_I2C_SDA_GPIO
        int "OLED SDA GPIO"
        default 21
        help
            Confirmed wiring, 2026-09-28: SDA -> GPIO21.

    config OLED_I2C_SCL_GPIO
        int "OLED SCL GPIO"
        default 22
        help
            Confirmed wiring, 2026-09-28: SCL -> GPIO22.

    config OLED_I2C_ADDR
        hex "SSD1306 7-bit I2C address"
        default 0x3C
        help
            0x3C on almost every 0.96" SSD1306 module. A few boards are
            wired to 0x3D instead (check the module's silkscreen/datasheet
            if the display stays blank).

    config OLED_ARENA_KB
        int "TFLite Micro tensor arena, upper bound (KB)"
        default 128
        help
            Upper bound only — main.cc clamps this to the largest free
            contiguous heap block minus a safety margin at boot, exactly
            like prototype/firmware. The Run 3 model measured 80,656 bytes
            used on the real board (CLAUDE.md §12.5), so 128 KB leaves
            headroom without wasting the whole 160 KB the first attempt used.

endmenu
